This directory bundles the following font files, unmodified. The variable
Arimo files, Tinos and Cousine come from the Google Fonts OFL collection
(google/fonts, ofl/{arimo,tinos,cousine}); the two static Arimo bold
instances come from the Arimo upstream repository (googlefonts/arimo,
fonts/ttf, commit 4a6255f269916ae7ad3fc2706b0935e7621396b8), which does not
publish them through google/fonts:

  - Arimo[wght].ttf
  - Arimo-Italic[wght].ttf
  - Arimo-Bold.ttf
  - Arimo-BoldItalic.ttf
    Arimo -- Copyright 2020 The Arimo Project Authors
    (https://github.com/googlefonts/arimo)

  - Tinos-Regular.ttf
  - Tinos-Bold.ttf
  - Tinos-Italic.ttf
  - Tinos-BoldItalic.ttf
    Tinos -- Copyright 2026 The Tinos Project Authors
    (https://github.com/googlefonts/tinos)

  - Cousine-Regular.ttf
  - Cousine-Bold.ttf
  - Cousine-Italic.ttf
  - Cousine-BoldItalic.ttf
    Cousine -- Copyright 2026 The Cousine Project Authors
    (https://github.com/googlefonts/cousine)

